nclick="bndQvAccToggle(this)"><span class="bnd-qv-acc-label">What's Included</span><span class="bnd-qv-acc-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"/></svg></span></button><div class="bnd-qv-acc-body"><div class="bnd-qv-desc"><ul><li>1 Swaptop&trade; Frame</li><li>1 Double-Sided Swaptop&trade;</li><li>1 Durable Carrying Case</li><li>6 Swaptop&trade; Rookie Darts</li><li>BONUS: Pro Popdart!</li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bnd-qv-cta"><button class="bnd-qv-add-btn" id="bnd-qv-add-btn" onclick="bndQvCtaClick()"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg><span id="bnd-qv-add-label">Add Top</span></button></div></div></div>
